# Who approves what. Changes under `apps/` need a maintainer. The rules, the scripts and the
# workflows run with the project's credentials, so they need an admin.
#
# GitHub applies the last matching line, so the specific rules come last.

*                       @appfair/maintainers

/apps/                  @appfair/maintainers
/policy.yaml            @appfair/admins
/scripts/               @appfair/admins
/.github/workflows/     @appfair/admins
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @appfair/admins
